	"AuthorLabel": "ShaMedic and D-Floe",
	"Description": "For this Mod Abigail is replaced with Demas and Emily is replaced with Apricot,\n<br />\n<br />Each character has:\n<br />\n<br />-A Custom Set of Sprites\n<br />-Unique Gift Preferences\n<br />-Some Changed Dialogue\n<br />-Custom Chat Box Images\n<br />\n<br />All other events are left unchanged, and are left unaltered at this time.\n<br />\n<br />The preferences for Demas are:\n<br />LOVE:\u00A0VOID MAYO, DIAMOND, VOID ESSENCE, CHEWING STICK\n<br />LIKE: WHEAT, ICE CREAM\n<br />NEUTRAL:\n<br />DISLIKE: GINGER ALE\n<br />HATE: BEER, MEAD, PALE ALE, WINE, GOAT CHEESE\n<br />\n<br />The preferences for Apricot are:\n<br />LOVE: APRICOT, SURVIVAL BURGER, SHRIMP, LEGEND FISH, LAVA EEL, FISH TACO\n<br />LIKE: [ALL FISH], DRIED STARFISH\n<br />NEUTRAL:\n<br />DISLIKE:\n<br />HATE: SPICY EEL, DINOSAUR MAYO\n<br />\n<br />Both Villagers share all Universal Likes, Dislikes, Etc.\n<br />\n<br />This mod includes a version for use with Stardew Valley Expanded, and one for Vanilla.",
